  "key_findings": [
    "Balanced class weighting allows the surrogate model to detect over 80.7% of fraud transactions without introducing artificial synthetic data artifacts.",
    "Utilisation ratio, account balance, transaction amount, and recent chargebacks serve as the strongest predictive indicators for transactional risk.",
    "The output scoring formula accurately produces a continuous non-fraud probability in [0.0, 1.0], with deterministic thresholding at score >= 0.50 for APPROVE and < 0.50 for DECLINE.",
    "Zero-loss handling of out-of-vocabulary channels via OneHotEncoder handle_unknown='ignore' enables robust scoring of unobserved channels without system exceptions.",
    "A 41-test automated suite validates 100% boundary adherence, input range rejection, serialization consistency, and deterministic scoring."
